y connected, and free of random explosions or shape glitches.\n\noverall_soundscape: High altitude wind broadens into an open airy rush, mixed with thin cloud turbulence and a long resonant tone from the unfolding plates. The mechanical petals produce clean ceramic-metal clicks in sequence, followed by one deep impact-like aperture close; no speech or voices.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A. The final edit will use a separate project-original instrumental track as the locked master audio.\n",
